    "That looks short. Saving it is fine — the board sees it marked as a short session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela semble court. Vous pouvez l'enregistrer — le comité la verra signalée comme session courte."
